panel:{id:"apiFeatures",content:'<div>Get access to our price history data of Amazon products with our API (application programming interface). It offers:</div><br><ul style="list-style: none; line-height: 19px; text-indent: -1.8em; padding-left: 1.8em;">\n                <li>&#x271C;&emsp;Over <a href="#!features" class="href -green">6 billion tracked products</a></li>\n                <li>&#x271C;&emsp;Live pricing and availability</li>\n                <li>&#x271C;&emsp;Price history data for almost all offer types: Amazon, Marketplace New and Used, Warehouse Deals, FBA, FBM, Collectibles, Refurbished - and many more.</li>\n                <li>&#x271C;&emsp;Sales Rank, Offers count, Rating and Review count history.</li>\n                <li>&#x271C;&emsp;Complete access to all marketplace offers</li>\n                <li>&#x271C;&emsp;Customizable price history graph images</li>\n                <li>&#x271C;&emsp;Extensive Buy Box information including price and seller history</li>\n                <li>&#x271C;&emsp;Category details, searches and browsing</li>\n                <li>&#x271C;&emsp;Product Finder: Search our entire database for products matching any criteria</li>\n                <li>&#x271C;&emsp;Best sellers lists containing up to 500k ASINs.</li>\n                <li>&#x271C;&emsp;Third party sellers metrics, including rating and rating count history, top seller lists, and storefront access with up to 100k ASINs.</li>\n                <li>&#x271C;&emsp;Find millions of deals that match your criteria with complete access to our Deals with search, filter and sorting capability.</li>\n                <li>&#x271C;&emsp;Easy use: Request data in JSON format via RESTful API, TLS encrypted.</li>\n                <li>&#x271C;&emsp;Ready to use <a target="_blank" href="https://packagist.org/packages/keepa/php_api" class="href -green">PHP</a> and <a target="_blank" href="https://github.com/keepacom/api_backend" class="href -green">Java framework</a> for fast integration</li>\n                <li>&#x271C;&emsp;English and German support via <a href="#!discuss/c/api/apisupport" class="href -green">forum</a> and <a target="_blank" href="mailto:info@keepa.com?subject=Keepa API" class="href -green">email</a></li>\n            </ul><div style="margin-top:25px;text-align: center;"><a target="_blank" href="mailto:info@keepa.com?subject=Questions about Keepa API" title="info@keepa.com" class="href -green">Have Questions? Contact us.</a>&emsp;<a rel="terms" class="href -green">Terms and Conditions</a></div>'},
