"")+'<div id="apiOffers"></div><div style="margin-top:25px;text-align: left; max-width: 800px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 25px;"><span>All plans are prepaid monthly and follow a flexible subscription model. You can cancel your subscription at any time. Multiple plans can be active under the same account, with instant upgrades available at any point and one downgrade permitted per month. Our plans vary based on the number of tokens generated per minute. In most cases, a single token is sufficient to access the full data for a product, though some advanced or detailed queries may require additional tokens. Unused tokens expire after one hour. For a detailed overview of how our API plans work, please refer to our <a href="https://keepa.com/#!discuss/t/how-our-api-plans-work/">documentation</a>.</span><br></div><div style="margin-top:25px;text-align: center;"><a target="_blank" href="mailto:info@keepa.com?subject=Questions about Keepa API" title="info@keepa.com" class="href -green">Have Questions? Contact us.</a>&emsp;<a rel="terms" class="href -green">Terms and Conditions</a></div><div style="font-size:smaller;text-align: center;margin-top: 15px;">Our API is only available to users that have registered a Keepa account.<br></div>'}}],
