					<h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Keepa.com: Access Temporarily Blocked</h2>
					<p>Your access to our services has been <strong>temporarily blocked${0<a.hours?` for ${a.hours} hours`:""}</strong> due to violations of our Terms of Service. We take these actions to ensure the safety and integrity of our service.</p>
					<h3>Key Guidelines for Subscription Usage</h3>
					<ul style="text-align: left; margin: 10px 15%;">
						<li style="margin-top: 8px;"><b>One Person, One Subscription</b><br>Our subscription is designed for individual use. It must be used exclusively by the person who registered it. Sharing with others, even within the same household or organization, is not allowed.</li>
						<li style="margin-top: 8px;"><b>Separate Accounts for Each User</b><br>If more than one person needs access to our services, each individual must have their own separate account with a distinct subscription. This applies to families, friends, colleagues, and any other groups.</li>
						<li style="margin-top: 8px;"><b>Avoid Unauthorized Services</b><br>The use of any account reselling service, group buy or account sharing browser extensions is strictly prohibited.</li>
						<li style="margin-top: 8px;"><b>No Scraping or Automation</b><br>The scraping of our data, use of automation tools, or any form of unauthorized data extraction from our platform is strictly forbidden.</li>
					</ul>
				<h3>Recommended Actions</h3>
					<ul style="text-align: left; list-style: inside; margin: 10px 15%;">
						<li>If multiple users require access, each user must create a separate account with its own subscription.</li>
						<li>Change your account password immediately by <a href="https://keepa.com/#!settings/2" target="_blank" style="color: #06f; text-decoration: none;">clicking here</a>.</li>
						<li>Check for and deactivate any browser extensions related to group buy or account reselling.</li>
						<li>Disable your VPN if you use one.</li>
						<li>Do not share your account credentials with anyone.</li>
						<li>Avoid using any form of automated scripts, bots, or software for data scraping or automated access to our platform.</li>
					</ul>
					<p>If you are certain this is an error please <a href="mailto:info@keepa.com?subject=Access%20Blocked%20Inquiry%20-%20${storage.username}%20-%20${a.IP}" style="color: #06f; text-decoration: none;">contact us</a>.</p>
					<p>Repeated violations will result in a <strong>permanent ban</strong> from our services. We value your participation and urge you to adhere to our Terms of Service for continued access.</p>
					<p>Thank you for your understanding and cooperation.</p>
